{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>That I may cause those who love me to inherit</b> — This is a term for the eternal possession acquired as an everlasting inheritance, and also a term for the possession of wealth. There is gold and an abundance of pearls and precious vessels. And there is a general statement and afterward a specification: gold and an abundance of pearls and precious vessels. And likewise the meaning of <b>and their treasures</b>."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:29.060687820Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}